# Expense Tracker

A simple command-line Expense Tracker application built with Python.

## Features

- Add an expense
- View all expenses
- Calculate total expenses
- View expenses by category
- Delete an expense
- Exit the application

## Concepts Used

- Variables
- Lists
- Dictionaries
- Functions
- Loops
- Conditional statements
- User input
- Exception handling
- CRUD operations

## How to Run

Make sure Python is installed.

Open the terminal inside the Expense Tracker folder and run:

```bash
python expense_tracker.py